          <body>**CDIF**

Definition
==========

Set of permissible values for a variable playing the role of a variable descriptor component. Each entry pairs a code (cdif:value) with the RepresentedVariable that the code identifies (cdif:isDefinedBy).
:idDescription: "Identifier for this DescriptorValueDomain node"
:rdfType: ``cdi:DescriptorValueDomain``</body>
          <annotatedElement xmi:idref="cdif.bbr.metadata.cdifDataType.cdifDescriptorVariable.DescriptorValueDomain"/>
